---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor SDD_SEQ_04_Admin as System Administrator
  participant SDD_SEQ_04_Service as Membership / billing service
  participant SDD_SEQ_04_DB as PostgreSQL
  SDD_SEQ_04_Admin->>SDD_SEQ_04_Service: activate Employee or apply renewal
  SDD_SEQ_04_Service->>SDD_SEQ_04_DB: transaction and organization coordination lock
  SDD_SEQ_04_Service->>SDD_SEQ_04_DB: read current/scheduled period and active seats
  alt requested capacity is valid
  SDD_SEQ_04_Service->>SDD_SEQ_04_DB: commit membership / period change
  SDD_SEQ_04_Service-->>SDD_SEQ_04_Admin: confirmed outcome
  else paid renewal below active Employee count
  SDD_SEQ_04_Service->>SDD_SEQ_04_DB: preserve paid evidence, WAITING_CAPACITY
  SDD_SEQ_04_Service-->>SDD_SEQ_04_Admin: explicit capacity remediation
  else unauthorized / stale / unavailable entitlement
  SDD_SEQ_04_Service-->>SDD_SEQ_04_Admin: reject, existing records preserved
  end
